[RGen] Add support for nested classes. (#23375)

We want to improve the API of strong dictionaries to be:

```csharp

public class MyConfigDictionary : DictionaryContainer {

  public static class Keys {
    // key properties
  }

  // properties
}
```

This commit allows the roslyn code generator to detect that we are
generating a nested class and do the right thing.

